2. ARTWORK (icons/)

The icons are NOT covered by section 1. They identify in-game operators,
abilities, weapons and gadgets, and the rights to the artwork they show stay
with their holders:

  - Operator, ability, weapon and gadget artwork is derived from
    Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege by Ubisoft Entertainment. All rights
    remain with Ubisoft Entertainment.

  - Many operator icons are based on r6operators by Marco Vockner,
    https://github.com/marcopixel/r6operators, published under the MIT
    licence reproduced below.

  - Icons drawn for this repository by contributors remain the work of their
    authors, who agree that they may be distributed with this repository and
    the app.

  If you are a rights holder and want an icon changed or removed, write to
